# Frontend Rules

## Stack
- React 18 + functional component + hooks
- TypeScript strict, không `any`
- Tailwind CSS, không CSS Modules
- State: Zustand (global), useState (local)
- Data fetching: TanStack Query

## Convention
- Component file: PascalCase `UserCard.tsx`
- Hook file: camelCase `useAuth.ts`
- Test: `*.test.tsx` cùng folder

## DO
- ✅ Memo expensive component với `memo` + `useMemo`
- ✅ Extract logic phức tạp thành custom hook
- ✅ Error boundary cho route level

## DON'T
- ❌ Inline object/array làm prop → re-render lung tung
- ❌ useEffect để fetch — dùng React Query
- ❌ Prop drilling > 2 cấp — lift hoặc dùng context

## Example
```tsx
// ✅ tốt
const items = useMemo(() => filter(data), [data])
return <List items={items} />

// ❌ tệ
return <List items={data.filter(...)} />
```
